{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":220156,\"title\":\"For One Night Only\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Rachid Badouri, Mariana Mazza, Dominic Paquet and P-A Méthot host four exclusive comedy shows in unexpected locations before a handful of lucky fans. Featuring a total of 25 comedians, this immersive comedy stand-up experience is as unique as it is enthralling! One Night Only is going to make you wish you were there!\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ianZK6hwlGeUGZJ0ftp8DNe470k.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/JRG244IfrRE/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":4,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"CA\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"cast\":[],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"JRG244IfrRE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"OvpkEvpEeN0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"6k02rmMVb8c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ianZK6hwlGeUGZJ0ftp8DNe470k.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"In a plush and mysterious atmosphere, P-A Méthot invites you to his secret society’s first event at the incredible Morrin Center in Old Quebec. Peek into the secret world of Cathy Gauthier, Billy Tellier, Yannick De Martino, Mathieu Cyr, Silvi Tourigny and Pascal Cameron behind closed doors, where the gags are no-holds-barred!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"From the Coconut Motel in Trois-Rivières, enjoy a tropical ambiance with Dominic Paquet and his guests! Featuring the sweetest cocktails, Hawaiian shirts and excellent comedy by Mélanie Ghanimé, Réal Béland, Maxim Martin, Mélanie Couture and Alexandre Barrette!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"For this unique night, Rachid Badouri invites you to dress up and attend his wedding vow renewal. In Montréal’s Old Port, the event is enlivened by the comedian’s good friends: Eddy King, Philippe-Audrey Larrue-St-Jacques, Jessica Chartrand, Emile Khoury and Mike Beaudoin.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Comedian and wrestling enthusiast Mariana Mazza invites you to join her in the ring at Foufounes Électriques for a sensational night at the heart of Montréal’s underground scene. Featuring Dave Morgan, Katherine Levac, Simon Delisle, P-O Forget and Korine Côté, the comedian hosts the Mazza Mania V, an event where comedy, spandex and sensational wrestling moves live happily side-by-side!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"runtime\":66}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-09-12\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}